ab.\nScore 3\n\nacceptability_evidence: Monitoring logs for compliance risks is a standard, legally aligned practice that violates no norms or sensibilities.\nScore 4\n\neffectiveness_evidence: The dashboard can improve traceability and proactive risk detection, but it does not by itself ensure the mandated automatic logging and record-keeping are implemented.\nScore 3\n\napplicability_evidence: The proposal directly targets Article 12(2) requirements for traceability, post-market monitoring and risk-related logging.\nScore 4\n\nReturn.\n\n",
